 ## Background
-The Voxel Instancing System is part of the Voxel Tools plugin for Godot. The system provides explicit control over mesh and material assignment per LOD, which is useful since Godot 4 added automatic mesh LOD that users might prefer instead [S1]. It is used in voxel-based games for terrain decoration [S1].
